{
  "schema": "orca.head_envelope.v1",
  "id": "sovol-sv06-ace",
  "name": "Sovol SV06 ACE head (MP3A02: high-flow ceramic-heater hotend, pressure-sensor nozzle probing, front 4020 blower, V-wheel carriage on X extrusion)",
  "provenance": "Sovol SV06 ACE head (MP3A02: high-flow ceramic-heater hotend, pressure-sensor nozzle probing, front 4020 blower, V-wheel carriage on X extrusion) Confidence: high. Sources: https://github.com/Sovol3d/SV06-ACE  (STEP.zip -> STEP/MP3A02 V1.1.STEP, full machine assembly); https://github.com/Sovol3d/SV06-ACE-PLUS  (firmware/config only, no CAD; head assumed identical). Measured from Sovol's full-machine STEP (MP3A02 V1.1). The STEP frame is already Z-up with the carriage at +y. Printer frame = STEP frame translated to the nozzle tip (88.95, 168.6, 168.2): +X right, +Y back. Head = every part whose bbox intersects a 150x150x110 mm window around the nozzle, minus the X extrusion, bed and belts. The lowest non-nozzle material is a rear carriage V-wheel at 5.82 (behind the nozzle, y 20.6..30.1). The front U duct (air deflector) and the silicone sock start at 6.44-6.47. The heater block underside is at 8.47; exposed_nozzle_length is measured to the sock (6.47). There is no separate probe: the pressure sensor sits at z 29.4. levels: footprint = bbox of all material at heights [z, next z), no margin. parts: per-component boxes (no margin), with U duct/sock rings decomposed on a 1 mm grid so the space around the nozzle stays open. Above z 14.4 the air-deflector upper box spans the nozzle axis and invents a little material between the sock (r 6) and the duct arms. A coverage check put every section point below 40 mm inside a box. Gantry: the X aluminium extrusion (\"x axis eccentric aluminum profile\") bottom is at 21.3 above the tip, at y 19.1..37.4. The wheels and carriage are part of the head. Nozzle: land radius 0.46 mm, 34.9-degree cone to Z=2.97, then the nozzle parts as recorded. Gantry: X beam underside 21.30 mm above the tip, Y 19.1..37.4, every X. Converted by scripts/nonplanar_heads/open_heads.py from research/head-envelopes/sovol-sv06-ace.json (2026-10-13). Nozzle-tip frame +X right, +Y rear, +Z up, mm. Body axial/lateral margins 0.3 mm. Not calibrated.",
